Package: on-air-core
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: LAN audio streaming core (AirPlay, Bluetooth, Sonos)
 Headless on-air control plane: HTTP/WebSocket on port 47990, mDNS
 advertisement, PIN pairing, and exclusive senders for AirPlay, Bluetooth,
 and Sonos. Pair with the desktop GUI package (on-air-desktop .deb from
 GitHub Releases) when you want a tray app.
